# reply", or the client's) does so at once, and the land comes straight back
# to her hand. Nothing else castable on either side. Bob (seat 1) holds a few
# Forests and nothing to do: he is only here to read alice's `waitingOn` fact
# on his own screen. Both libraries hold lands so no draw step loses.
